\code{name_corrections}, (2) an exact case-sensitive name match, and (3) a
case-insensitive exact match. Variables documented for the selected wave
but absent from \code{data} are left untouched and recorded as \code{"not found"} in
the generic matching audit.

\code{name_corrections}, \code{to_factor}, \code{to_numeric}, \code{standardize_names}, and
